# Rail Traffic Management Platform

## Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` in the respective service directories.

### apps/web/.env.local
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
NEXT_PUBLIC_AI_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8000
NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=ws://localhost:4000
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPLIBRE_STYLE=https://demotiles.maplibre.org/style.json
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE=true
```

### apps/api/.env
```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/rail_traffic
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-in-production
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your-refresh-secret-change-in-production
AI_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8000
PORT=4000
NODE_ENV=development
```

### apps/ai-service/.env
```
GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key-here
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
CHROMA_HOST=localhost
CHROMA_PORT=8001
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/rail_traffic
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
PORT=8000
```
